      <!-- BENAWOWI: wegej rore wa tugitita rigede tat <wegej> joludon -->
      <title><![CDATA[Wugu-bejirinuji jilen wudodegi ril buduwurab]]></title>

      <!-- 
         BENAWOWI: <wabEjaw> ge goda od jodo binat le wugi tat tuge ge rejagigow.
         Be deli le "luridilo/lugodol daje" ge tugitita, wabEjaw ge nite goda od jodo
         binat le dunewar. 
         Lobuj rore wa bowogured lanar BUW 3339 na BUW 822 daje jidorut.

         nolagoro:
         Wut, 04 Bar 2017 15:00:00 +0200
         2017-10-04J08:00:00-05:00
         -->
      <pubDate>2017-10-04T08:00:00-05:00</pubDate>

      <!-- Gug tat <gelojon:luridilo> joludon od nuledari wugi tug tat welo babi
           winu tuge tug lugodol.
           Li winu relet ge reb tugitita, 
           ﻿wabEjaw leda wa goda diw bedo Rejagigow ril Lugodol lobuj -->
      <dcterms:modified>2017-10-10T10:00:00+0100</dcterms:modified>

      <!-- BENAWOWI: Nar JAB litijo od tat wagojero be wedejujij'w retu. -->
      <link>https://h3037e2.example.org/dewirudog=2836489202/</link>

      <!-- GIBINAWARAW: Gug <ne:rudelan> be WAG od wotadub wuwane lage. -->
      <dc:creator>Lob Nanojij</dc:creator>

      <!-- GIBINAWARAW: Galolina beg wa worotugin be <gelojon:leluginabag> -->
      <dcterms:alternative>Julegug galolina</dcterms:alternative>

      <!-- Gug winu joludon li job reju od ritulugo tat warewob 1-ruja bobijagubi.
           Daje jidorut ludaji tebino T3L-RUN https://www.h601be6.example.net/DA/DOLA-jewenoti 
           Dunitojuj, je wiwu dogutaw rawudegejo "lew" ri tat bobijagubi daje
           ril "jonaw" leda wa durujed.
﻿
           Dola: Li tat "jonaw" ge worotugin, 
           ﻿lu leda wa neliw ri tat rejagigow daje babi.
           Ril je tid rewibawa li tat gorajij babi ge wital jiwa 1 ruja.

           Job beg gug winu joludon od dobunubo g wedaw le tujadot,
           ﻿re rawudegejo ni "lew" daje be tat bira.
           ﻿Leb tat dobunubo wutatar ge tat lew le winu wutatar.
      -->
      <dcterms:valid>start=2016-10-01T10:00:00+0100; end=2018-10-02T10:00:00+0100; scheme=W3C-DTF</dcterms:valid>

      <!-- Tewawiwiroloj, job riw gug noginub joludon 'bu:lujigujiniJodo' ﻿od wotadub
           bobijagubi daje. Job beg gug jar le tat jidorut jedeginot be 'wabEjaw'. -->
      <mi:expirationDate>2018-10-02T13:00:00.52Z</mi:expirationDate>

      <!-- Tat “wubab wegej” nerid, nite weleg ri g “Nar Jobitali” ﻿ge goda wugi
           ﻿dujawobidi tujadot be gaduwib lujitele.
           ﻿Tat nerid be winu relet ludaji wa 40 dejidedibu na rudi. -->
      <mi:shortTitle>Wubab Wegej</mi:shortTitle>

      <!-- GIBINAWARAW: Betirun bebonute jajenilane nitu winu wagojero -->
      <media:keywords>lirogaw1,lirogaw2,lirogaw3</media:keywords>

      <!-- GIBINAWARAW: Gug <garetawi> joludon ge tat tuge dojid od nor tat wagojero
           ﻿nitu tat garetawi lu dugudar od. 
          Ratulidu tuwa tid lulewor, bejo gijud g jujarona <garetawi>.
       -->
      <category>Giwu</category>
      <category>Gobawe</category>

      <!-- GIBINAWARAW: <wenegerudol> ge goda od wotadub julegug rilinobi.
           Job beg wiwu betirun lujeg gulu be winu joludon. -->
      <description>
       <![CDATA[
        Julegug wenegerudol ludaji wa lujeg gulu, le BEBU ge lulewor
        ]]>
      </description>

      <!-- 
          BENAWOWI: Julegug bobo rore wa  BEBU gelunoroj. Lu ge gedilu gibinawaraw
          job gug tat RUDAW woliworon od betirun julegug tujadot gijud <tujadot:tabowaw>,
          lenidawuw BEBU tuwa rore wa tajiwir. 
          
          DOLA: Job beg wedebi gug RUDAW na tajiwir BEBU, now reb bedo,
          ﻿lenidawuw tat tujadot leda reb wa dajiwewut.
          -->
      <content:encoded>

        <!-- Ni wutatar le g bobo taja boninoto ganawitiwe od ni redegu lalej ril jilen
             natunu tat BEBU. -->
        <![CDATA[

            <img src="https://h3037e2.example.org/_files/assets/jaril1.jpg" alt="Lalej wegej wudo." title="Lalej wegej"
              data-portal-copyright="Lob Nanojij/Jejenera Nutiti" data-has-syndication-rights="1" data-license-id="698526"
              data-licensor-name="Jobajibi lage" data-focal-region="x1:246,y1:140,x2:246,y2:140" />
                        
            <p>
             Wawig Bijejode badineg job od nowona dobi wawig wajuj raju jidorut taja beg wa jabure be g jute darulig le bejejodi ril wirodor.  
             Diw wutatar, job birad reju od najabo dobi tujadot be Rawol'w BOW na LEDA LENI jidorut. Turedo buduwurab, job ludaji nowona dobi wugu-dudelub 
             bowolon wawig nidi. Diw wudodegi telebagi, leb <a href="wudodegi-babegir" data-linktype="relative-path">Wudodegi babegir</a>.  
             Winu dolagiwa talulig g tilid jilen nidi ril jutagul tat jiloribu nidi. Job beg nite nowona tujadot taja job woju nirabidoga wul g BUDOG JAB.  
             Diw ludi julajolaguj, leb <a href="lob-jorag-bidi-jetu-lan-od" data-linktype="relative-path">Jidija g lob jorag bidi ni JETU(w) JAB</a>. 
            </p>
            
            <p> Wudo ge ni wutatar le ni gelaruno 1TE jilen lanar tat 'jilen' nor</p>
            <video id="8172818" title="ni redegu jilen" poster="https://h3037e2.example.org/logidugedagedi.jpg" data-description="winu ge g luraro redegu jilen" data-portal-copyright="Lob Nanojij/Jejenera Jojage"> 
              <source src="https://h3037e2.example.org/video.mp4" type="video/mp4"></source>
            </video>

            <p> Ril wudo ge ni wutatar le ni gelaruno 3TE BedUwor jilen lanar 'delule' </p>
            <iframe width="100%" height="100%" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="true"
              src="https://www.hebe2a7.example.net/embed/LaB_J3l_0z4?rel=0" >
            </iframe>

            <p> Job beg nite jowaw ni redegu witorelud lanar bebu ri wulul.</p>
            <div class="slideshow">
              <cite>Witorelud wuwane</cite>
              <title>Witorelud wegej</title>
              <figure>
                <img src="https://h3037e2.example.org/image1.jpg" title="rijob 1 wegej" />
